  "content": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://terrariacraft.com/\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://github.com/terrariacraft/News/blob/master/media/logo3.png?raw=true\" alt=\"\" width=\"622\" height=\"150\" /></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"http://discord.terrariacraft.com/\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #00ccff; font-size: 24px; text-decoration: underline;\">DISCORD</span></strong></span></a></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a class=\"js-qwynlraxz\" href=\"https://discord.terrariacraft.com\"><img src=\"https://ds.zeith.org/cards/tc.png\" width=\"510\" height=\"170\" /></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>这个模组添加了来自《泰拉瑞亚》的内容。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>我们的<span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 24px;\"><strong>计划</strong></span>是将95%以上的《泰拉瑞亚》内容添加到《我的世界》中。我们的团队正在为此努力。</h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><a href=\"https://terrariacraft.com/\"><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\">请务必访问我们的网站，我们有自定义启动器用于早期访问版本！</span></a></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #800000; font-size: 36px;\">免责声明：</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #800000; font-size: 36px;\">此模组是一个独立项目，不打算作为模组包的一部分使用。仅支持附加组件。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #800000; font-size: 36px;\">OptiFine？不支持。<span style=\"font-size: 8px;\">除非未来立方区块支持它。</span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #800000;\"><span style=\"font-size: 36px;\">此模组不支持安卓/iOS模拟的《我的世界：Java版》，请不要寻求支持。</span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #800000;\"><span style=\"font-size: 36px;\">此模组在专用服务器上存在问题，通常不打算与其兼容。</span></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"color: #800000; font-size: 24px;\">如果你是拥有10k+订阅者的YouTuber，并希望录制展示视频，请在Discord上联系我们以获取早期访问权限。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">注意：</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><b>此模组需要 </b></span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; color: #00ffff;\"><b><a class=\"js-qwynlraxz\" style=\"color: #00ffff; text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/4Y5irTB9\"><img src=\"https://curseforge.zeith.org/api/v2/logo?id=289079\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" />&nbsp;Music Layer 12.2.22+</a></b></span><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><b> 才能运行！</b></span></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><b>此模组需要 </b></span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; color: #00ffff;\"><b><a class=\"js-qwynlraxz\" style=\"color: #00ffff; text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/PlkSuVtM\"><img src=\"https://curseforge.zeith.org/api/v2/logo?id=247401\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" />&nbsp;HammerLib 12.2.49+</a></b></span><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><b> 才能运行！</b></span></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><b>此模组需要 </b></span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; color: #00ffff;\"><b><a class=\"js-qwynlraxz\" style=\"color: #00ffff; text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/C7cTlgwS\"><img src=\"https://curseforge.zeith.org/api/v2/logo?id=899883\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" />&nbsp;HammerAnimations 12.2.21+</a></b></span><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><b> 才能运行！</b></span></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><b>此模组需要 </b></span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; color: #00ffff;\"><b><a class=\"js-qwynlraxz\" style=\"color: #00ffff; text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/8Tb4j8xo\"><img src=\"https://curseforge.zeith.org/api/v2/logo?id=292243\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" />&nbsp;OpenCubicChunks 0.0.1055+</a></b></span><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><b> 才能运行！</b></span></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><b>此模组与 </b></span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; color: #00ffff;\"><b><a class=\"js-qwynlraxz\" style=\"color: #00ffff; text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/WbZWY2NM\"><img src=\"https://curseforge.zeith.org/api/v2/logo?id=341357\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" />&nbsp;Corsair McCUE 12.4.10</a></b></span><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><b> 兼容！</b></span></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><b>此模组与 </b></span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; color: #00ffff;\"><b><a class=\"js-qwynlraxz\" style=\"color: #00ffff; text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/mEr4VarV\"><img src=\"https://curseforge.zeith.org/api/v2/logo?id=347912\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" />&nbsp;ColoredLux 12.6.33+</a></b></span><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><b> 搭配效果更佳！</b></span></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><strong>配置文件位于 .minecraft/terraria/ModConfigs.cfg</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>一些图片：</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/GbY79zK.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/NKNTxcN.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/aYpvs2k.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8py6ARh.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/6bj8LVF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/bM7i2yw.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/uceyTfD.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/v60FBPr.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/shdOCIA.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8fy0BpD.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/bNoKKYU.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/4sGoJfG.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/3qstYfM.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ENk952p.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/pkrU06y.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/DWefkt1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">如果你想更早获取内容，欢迎订阅我们的Patreon！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">你还需要一个付费的《我的世界》账户，并且必须加入我们的Terraria Craft Discord服务器。</span></p>\n<p><a class=\"js-qwynlraxz\" href=\"https://www.patreon.com/join/zeitheron/checkout?rid=3054296\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/mrak7w3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"460\" height=\"200\" /></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/LuJJMv1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"698\" height=\"1\" /></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>权限：</strong></p>\n<ul style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>你可以在你的模组包中使用此模组。</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>未经我的许可（通过Discord私信<img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/icons/zeitheron.png\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" />&nbsp;Zeitheron），你不得将此模组重新发布到其他网站，且必须提供Modrinth/CurseForge下载链接。</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>你不允许将此模组（或DragonForge团队的任何其他模组）包含在你自己的模组中。构建附加组件是允许的，但最好先友好地私信我。</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>注意：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>唯一支持的《我的世界》版本是此模组存在的最新版本。请不要要求降级！</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a class=\"js-qwynlraxz\" href=\"https://ds.zeith.org/dev\"><img src=\"https://ds.zeith.org/cards/dev.png\" width=\"510\" height=\"170\" /></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>或者你可以加入我们的专用服务器：（开发进度、社区和反馈）</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a class=\"js-qwynlraxz\" href=\"https://discord.terrariacraft.com\"><img src=\"https://ds.zeith.org/cards/tc.png\" width=\"510\" height=\"170\" /></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>想讨论什么吗？需要API帮助？</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>加入Discord服务器并关注Zeitheron的<a class=\"js-qwynlraxz\" href=\"http://bit.ly/ZeithTwitter\"><img src=\"https://abs.twimg.com/favicons/twitter.ico\" alt=\"\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" />Twitter</a>！</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>如果你想支持我的工作，可以通过<a class=\"js-qwynlraxz\" href=\"https://www.patreon.com/zeitheron\"><img src=\"https://c5.patreon.com/external/favicon/favicon-32x32.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" />&nbsp;Patreon</a>成为赞助者。</strong></p>",
